# ============================================================================
# BC-XAI Research Operating System — Canonical .gitignore (STEP-002 / OS §10.2)
# Protects Tier-2 Restricted Medical Data, Tier-3 Binary Artifacts, Secrets,
# and Local Structural Reference Templates from entering Git history.
# ============================================================================

# 0. Local-only reference files in workspace (never pushed to thesis remote)
OPG_RESEARCH_OPERATING_SYSTEM.md
OPG_PROJECT_EXECUTION_BLUEPRINT.md
Title_defence_evaluation_report.pdf

# 1. Tier-2 Restricted Medical Data & Patient Linkage (NEVER COMMIT)
03_Datasets/raw/
03_Datasets/manifests/*_private_linkage*
03_Datasets/splits/*/private_*
04_Labels_XAI_Governance/native/
04_Labels_XAI_Governance/exports/
04_Labels_XAI_Governance/restricted_masks/
05_Preprocessing/processed/
05_Preprocessing/fitted_states/*.pkl
05_Preprocessing/fitted_states/*.npz
05_Preprocessing/fitted_states/*.pt
*.dcm
*.dicom
*.pgm
*.nii
*.nii.gz

# 2. Tier-3 Model Checkpoints, Weights & Raw Attribution Dumps (NEVER COMMIT)
06_Models/weights/
08_Checkpoints/*.pt
08_Checkpoints/*.pth
08_Checkpoints/*.ckpt
08_Checkpoints/*.h5
08_Checkpoints/*.keras
08_Checkpoints/*.onnx
08_Checkpoints/*.safetensors
08_Checkpoints/*.bin
09_Evaluation/EVAL*/predictions_raw*
09_Evaluation/EVAL*/xai/raw_arrays/
09_Evaluation/EVAL*/bootstrap_replicates/
15_Archive/bundles/
16_Web_Demo/samples_raw/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.keras
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.npz
*.parquet

# 3. Python, Virtual Environments, Caches & Build Artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# 4. Notebooks, Secrets, Credentials & OS Metadata
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
*secret*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
